WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.710
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:03.810
When you bake at home,
think about the people

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:06.090
that you are serving food to.

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:07.830
The people that you
love, the people you

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:09.320
want to please with your food.

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:12.278
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:19.180
Perfect.

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:22.138
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:24.110 --> 00:00:25.950
The first contact you
have with the food

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:27.690
is always a visual contact.

00:00:27.690 --> 00:00:30.000
My pastries are
like a silent film.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.230
You have to be seduced by it.

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:36.250
That's amazing.

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:37.720
I'm going to teach
you the building

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:40.570
blocks of pastry, with a
simple recipe make something

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:42.560
beautiful.

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:44.980
You have to learn to
really master a croissant.

00:00:44.980 --> 00:00:46.980
I call it the omelet of pastry.

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:48.850
It should feel super
fluffy and light.

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:50.380
I look at this honeycomb.

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:52.840
This air pocket flakes all over.

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:54.595
This is a really
beautiful croissant.

00:00:54.595 --> 00:00:57.550
I think it's very important to
have everything in front of you

00:00:57.550 --> 00:00:59.380
before you start doing anything.

00:00:59.380 --> 00:01:01.690
When you whisk something,
everything is in the wrist.

00:01:01.690 --> 00:01:04.480
Draw an eight with your
whisk, and then draw a zero.

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:06.570
You repeat this forever.

00:01:06.570 --> 00:01:08.010
[LAUGHS]

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:10.620
Pastry is very precise
and scientific.

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:14.160
You have to measure,
prepare, plan.

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:15.330
Less than three seconds.

00:01:15.330 --> 00:01:18.000
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:01:19.340 --> 00:01:22.868
Being creative is everything.

00:01:22.868 --> 00:01:24.970
Super smooth, shiny.

00:01:24.970 --> 00:01:27.600
You can see the glaze
that's been done properly.

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:30.395
When you look into it, you
can see your reflection.

00:01:30.395 --> 00:01:34.040
[LAUGHS]

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:35.690
You can be creative as well.

00:01:35.690 --> 00:01:38.480
Being creative is also
connecting with people.

00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:40.650
Think about who you
are serving food to.

00:01:40.650 --> 00:01:42.330
Baking can be daunting.

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:44.390
You should never be intimidated.

00:01:44.390 --> 00:01:47.150
Anyone can be a great
baker with a good teacher.

00:01:47.150 --> 00:01:51.490
I'm Dominique Ansel, and
this is my MasterClass.

